    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "painting a blank canvas sounds like a lot of work for someone who isnt even there. it feels so heavy. like, why bother trying to find a \"new\" me when the version of me that actually mattered is just dead? i feel like i'm just a shell lingering around out of habit. i don't see the point in trying to build someone new when that person was the only one worth being.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
